---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import ContentLayout from '../components/ContentLayout.astro';
import FeatureCard from '../components/FeatureCard.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="About TRYP" description="Learn what TRYP is building for passengers and drivers in Limpopo." path="/about/">
  <PageHero eyebrow="About TRYP" title={'Built for the<br /><em>journey here.</em>'} description="TRYP is a local ride platform designed to make everyday movement simpler for passengers and create new opportunity for drivers." />
  <ContentLayout items={[{ href: '#why', label: 'Why TRYP' }, { href: '#approach', label: 'Our approach' }, { href: '#where', label: 'Where we are going' }]}>
    <h2 id="why">Why we are building TRYP</h2>
    <p class="lead">Everyday transport should feel more understandable, more connected, and more relevant to the places people actually live.</p>
    <p>TRYP is starting in Limpopo, South Africa, with a focus on practical local rides. We are building for passengers who need a dependable way to get around and for drivers who want a flexible way to participate in their local economy.</p>
    <h2 id="approach">Our approach</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <FeatureCard icon="⌖" title="Local first" text="We pay attention to the roads, places, and everyday patterns of the communities we serve." tone="red" />
      <FeatureCard icon="♢" title="Clear by design" text="We prefer useful information and straightforward actions over unnecessary complexity." tone="blue" />
      <FeatureCard icon="◷" title="Growing carefully" text="We are adding capability as the service, support, and local operating model mature." tone="gold" />
    </div>
    <h2 id="where">Where we are going</h2>
    <p>TRYP is beginning with passenger and driver mobile apps, supported by a public website and an operations console. Over time, the service will expand its local coverage, improve pickup accuracy, and add the tools that make a real difference to the people using it.</p>
    <div class="notice"><strong>TRYP is in active rollout.</strong><br />Some public information, store links, support details, and legal documents will be finalized before the official public launch.</div>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button button-red" href="/ride/">Ride with TRYP →</a><a class="button button-outline" href="/drive/">Drive with TRYP →</a></div>
  </ContentLayout>
</SiteLayout>
